Alembic migration environment for WhistleDrop AI.

The schema is reproducible from these migrations alone. Never alter the
database by hand — write a migration.

    alembic upgrade head                 # apply everything
    alembic current                      # what the database is at
    alembic history --verbose            # what exists
    alembic downgrade -1                 # step back one
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "msg"
    alembic check                        # fail if models and DB disagree

The DSN comes from settings (DATABASE_URL). To target a different database:

    ALEMBIC_DATABASE_URL=... alembic upgrade head
    alembic -x db_url=... upgrade head
